{"repositoryId":1256145070,"availability":"available","full":"empty-sekai/sekai-custom-profile-sdk","name":"sekai-custom-profile-sdk","description":"Unofficial Project SEKAI custom profile SDK for authoring, native and WebGL2 rendering, interaction, and export.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":13,"forks":2,"created":"2026-06-01T13:59:03Z","updated":"2026-10-15T03:24:11Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://empty-sekai.github.io/sekai-custom-profile-sdk/","topics":["custom-profile","pjsk","project-sekai"],"demo":"https://profile.emptysekai.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:53.294Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:53.294Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:53.294Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T11:49:53.294Z","stars":13,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sekai Custom Profile SDK is an unofficial development kit for Project SEKAI (PJSK) custom profile cards. It edits game-compatible card documents and renders them, natively on the CPU or in the browser with WebGL2.","Rich text and layout follow a compatibility model of the Unity TextMesh Pro data, tags and runtime behavior that PJSK uses. The model covers the tags, layout, materials and dynamics this repository implements and tests. Game behavior it does not model, and later game updates, can differ from the client, so the SDK does not guarantee the game's rendering logic or final pixels."],"features":["Game-structure-compatible authoring documents with transactions,","gestures, undo/redo, checkpoints and export.","One backend-independent Rust core for profile and masterdata resolution,","dynamics, stable IDs, masks, controls and interaction geometry, shared by both renderers.","TextMesh Pro-compatible rich-text parsing and layout, with FreeType"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/empty-sekai/sekai-custom-profile-sdk/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"34b1d672ed9fee6bf40ca3e11179